error: an `#[umbral(m2m = ...)] M2M<T>` field needs a sibling `#[sqlx(skip)]` attribute. M2M stores no column on this table, so without `#[sqlx(skip)]` the `#[derive(sqlx::FromRow)]` decoder tries to read it as a real column and the first fetch fails at RUNTIME with `ColumnNotFound`. Add `#[sqlx(skip)]` above this field (it is the `sqlx::FromRow` derive's attribute, which any model with an `M2M` field also derives in order to be fetchable).
